{"3992570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TrackLand", "steam_appid": 3992570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game came from a very simple challenge:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could I design a car that combines <strong>massive off-road suspension</strong> with blazingly fast, <strong>high-downforce cornering</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...turns out, <i>yes</i>.<br>And it's pretty darn fun to rip around a track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here's my idea for the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race this impossibly fun car across a scenic island archipelago chock-full of time trial tracks and challenges. Each track has 5 ghosts that you must beat to the finish line. The bravest among you will 5-star every track, but you don't HAVE to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can venture out and do some seriously intense track hunting, and then chill  for a bit and just  drive around exploring these scenic islands. It's quite pleasant if I do say so myself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's also very important to me that this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. is small and boots up  fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. will run on potato.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, that's it for now. I am actively developing this game on my YouTube channel, which you can find in the game social's section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider <strong>wishlisting</strong> before you go, follow along with the development on my youtube channel, and thank you so much for checking it out.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game came from a very simple challenge:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could I design a car that combines <strong>massive off-road suspension</strong> with blazingly fast, <strong>high-downforce cornering</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...turns out, <i>yes</i>.<br>And it's pretty darn fun to rip around a track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here's my idea for the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race this impossibly fun car across a scenic island archipelago chock-full of time trial tracks and challenges. Each track has 5 ghosts that you must beat to the finish line. The bravest among you will 5-star every track, but you don't HAVE to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can venture out and do some seriously intense track hunting, and then chill  for a bit and just  drive around exploring these scenic islands. It's quite pleasant if I do say so myself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's also very important to me that this game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. is small and boots up  fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. will run on potato.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, that's it for now. I am actively developing this game on my YouTube channel, which you can find in the game social's section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please consider <strong>wishlisting</strong> before you go, follow along with the development on my youtube channel, and thank you so much for checking it out.</p>", "short_description": "Race and explore your way across a scenic island full of time trial track challenges. Massive suspension travel meets corner-crushing downforce for an addicting blend of rally and circuit racing.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992570/625575a677f427c5a32ac739951f4d574c0cebf2/header.jpg?t=1770747769", "capsule_